25: Right grip sense touch","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4734737598/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4737969052","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4737969052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4737969052,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGmernA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T04:17:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T04:17:36Z","body":"Great, thanks for testing!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4737969052/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746632233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4746632233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4746632233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGuvcKQ","user":{"login":"Snerfoil","id":33466239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDY2MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33466239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil","html_url":"https://github.com/Snerfoil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snerfoil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T22:29:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T22:54:58Z","body":"I went and tested with with the Steam Controller (2026). Godot 4.7 still doesn't recognize this yet the official SDL example programs do. (using Input.get_connected_joypads() doesn't list the Steam Controller as a joystick of any kind.)\r\n\r\noh I forgot to mention this was attempted on Linux under wayland.\r\n\r\n(edit: just tried the same thing under windows with same results)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746632233/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4747229080","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4747229080","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4747229080,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGvT3mA","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T00:30:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T16:16:29Z","body":"From my testing the Steam Controller (2026) works fine on Windows 11 with this PR out of the box. Tested both over puck, bluetooth and wired, with Steam client open and closed.\r\nTested on the [joypads demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/joypads) (with buttons expanded to 26), and the motion controls demo attached to that PR.\r\nAll extra buttons are recognized, except for 20 and 21 but only when the Steam client is open because then it binds the touchpads to the mouse, but that can be disabled.\r\n\r\nOne important thing I noticed is that launching the engine through Steam (by adding the editor to the library as a Non-Steam game) surprisingly makes the controller *less* functional, due to forcing on Steam Input with seemingly no way to disable it for the Steam Controller, which means it'd apply to all Godot games on Steam.\r\nNone of the non-standard actions (20-25) are uniquely recognized anymore, and (especially concerningly) it makes it not recognize the gyroscope whatsoever.\r\nI imagine this is something that'll have to be looked into on Valve's end.\r\n\r\nEdit: Tested the recent trackpads PR since the latest rebase. Results are the same as previous testing, everything works, having steam open and use the trackpads for the mouse cursor surprisingly doesnt affect anything, launching the editor through Steam makes the functions do nothing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4747229080/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4748483144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4748483144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4748483144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGwgaSA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T04:26:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T07:34:12Z","body":"> I went and tested with with the Steam Controller (2026). Godot 4.7 still doesn't recognize this yet the official SDL example programs do. (using Input.get_connected_joypads() doesn't list the Steam Controller as a joystick of any kind.)\r\n> \r\n> oh I forgot to mention this was attempted on Linux under wayland.\r\n> \r\n> (edit: just tried the same thing under windows with same results)\r\n\r\nHello, this PR hasn't been merged yet, Godot 4.7 still uses SDL 3.2.28 :)\r\n\r\nThank you for testing, Snerfoil and ettiSurreal!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4748483144/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754324758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4754324758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4754324758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG2E9Fg","user":{"login":"geowarin","id":1045636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1045636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin","html_url":"https://github.com/geowarin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T19:51:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T12:11:04Z","body":"Tested on KDE Linux (wayland, arch) with the new steam controller. Works perfectly, including gyros!\r\n\r\nHowever, I had to close steam, otherwise my controller right joystick was used as a mouse. This is a really annoying beahvior, I wonder if we can do something about it.\r\n\r\nHere is the project I used. I had to dig it up in the gyro PR, maybe we should add them to the godot-demo-projects?\r\n\r\n[joy_motion_sensors_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29175841/joy_motion_sensors_test.zip)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754324758/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754630148","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4754630148","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4754630148,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG2XmBA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T20:50:34Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T20:50:34Z","body":"> Tested on KDE Linux (wayland, arch) with the new steam controller. Works perfectly, including gyros!\n\nThat's great to hear, thanks for testing! :)\n\n> However, I had to close steam, otherwise my controller right joystick was used as a mouse. This is a really annoying beahvior, I wonder if we can do something about it.\n\nHm, not sure, maybe we should also test the testcontroller application from SDL and see how that behaves. If it also behaves like that there (which it likely does), we can ask the SDL developers through a new GitHub issue on SDL's repository.\n\n> Here is the project I used. I had to dig it up in the gyro PR, maybe we should add them to the godot-demo-projects?\n> \n> [joy_motion_sensors_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29149426/joy_motion_sensors_test.zip)\n> \n\nHm, good idea.\nAnother idea I have is to add a cube that would rotate with gyro motion, that's how gyroscope can be tested in SDL's testcontroller.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754630148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754892153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4754892153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4754892153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG2nleQ","user":{"login":"geowarin","id":1045636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1045636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin","html_url":"https://github.com/geowarin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geowarin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T21:47:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T21:47:09Z","body":"\r\n> Hm, not sure, maybe we should also test the testcontroller application from SDL and see how that behaves. If it also behaves like that there (which it likely does), we can ask the SDL developers through a new GitHub issue on SDL's repository.\r\n\r\nYeah, same thing. It's actually a setting in steam. In controller > Advanced settings\r\n\r\n<img width=\"622\" height=\"209\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cfd9805d-b554-430a-9a3d-89cab70bfa12\" />\r\n\r\nI understand the intention behind it but I can see it being confusing for users that run games outside of steam.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754892153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754926460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4754926460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4754926460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG2prfA","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T21:53:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T21:53:16Z","body":"> Yeah, same thing. It's actually a setting in steam. In controller > Advanced settings\r\nI understand the intention behind it but I can see it being confusing for users that run games outside of steam.\r\n\r\nI was about to comment on the exact cause of this.\r\nThe desktop layout actually lets you switch between Desktop and Gamepad modes by holding down the Start button (Desktop mode has a bunch of stuff bound to the usual mouse/keyboard buttons, while gamepad mode only has the touchpads bound to the mouse).\r\nI think the issue is that they just don't mention this anywhere, so you can only find this accidentally or by finding it in the Desktop Layout settings.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754926460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4757318177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4757318177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4757318177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG47qIQ","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-20T10:18:48Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T10:18:48Z","body":"Wouldn't that just be a matter of calling [`DisableSteamTritonLizardMode`](https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/blob/49879ba0d6997709765caa53d9029b2c3551f1eb/src/joystick/hidapi/SDL_hidapi_steam_triton.c#L127) when launching the Godot game? Although it looks like that should already be called by [`UpdateDevice`](https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/blob/49879ba0d6997709765caa53d9029b2c3551f1eb/src/joystick/hidapi/SDL_hidapi_steam_triton.c#L497) which I believe is called when the joystick is connected.\r\n\r\nLooking more into this, it looks like this may be [expected behavior](https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/issues/15471#issuecomment-4455538194) and the problem is on Steam Input rather than SDL. There already seems to be an issue open about this in https://github.com/ValveSoftware/steam-for-linux/issues/13314.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4757318177/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4865077567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4865077567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120373","id":4865077567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIfsxPw","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T11:14:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T11:14:01Z","bod